OL,3,GNEWSAProperties evacuated for gas main
OL,4,Arepair work
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour properties have been evacuated and
OL,7,Fthree businesses closed "as a
OL,8,Fprecaution" while work to investigate a
OL,9,Ftown's gas network is carried out.
OL,11,FGas distribution company SGN said the
OL,12,Fclosure of Duke Street in
OL,13,FHenley-on-Thames to traffic followed
OL,14,Femergency repair work.
OL,16,FNo date for the end of the work has
OL,17,Fbeen given, and the street remains open
OL,18,Fto pedestrians.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
